OpenStack Cloud Shell client
https://github.com/openstack-afterglow/openstack-client

Provenance and changes
----------------------
This is an enhanced and maintained DMS version of Gerard Braad's
openstack-client: https://gitlab.com/gbraad/openstack-client
The retained upstream history ends at d332a95c8e0180d82f248cd17b6fae81e6e27b67;
the subsequent DMS GitLab source revision is 434529e.
Upstream also acknowledged Lars Kellogg-Stedman's OpenStack Tools
(https://github.com/larsks/openstack-tools) and GitLab's infrastructure.

Maintained changes include Python 3.12/OpenSSL 3, hash-locked OpenStack CLI
plugins, a non-root Cloud Shell with tmpfs credential bootstrap, and native
amd64/arm64 CI with gated GHCR publication.

